WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.440
Most tenders ask the same questions in different words.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:09.530
Keep your approved answers in one Answer library for the whole organisation.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.460
Pull one into a bid, then tailor it to the buyer.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.270
Write less from scratch.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:15.960
Velstrian Bid.
